    Document a tested LDAP configuration (#8217)
    
    The feature file and the default security configuration claimed that
    LDAP has not been tested with Spring Security 5. It has now been tested
    against the public LDAP test server provided by Forum Systems: login
    through LDAP bind authentication, rejected logins for a wrong password
    and an unknown user, database login still working, and name, email and
    roles provided by the LDAP user directory.
    
    Replace the outdated comments, link the documentation from the security
    configuration and add the tested configuration to the documentation as a
    complete example, crediting Forum Systems for the test server.
    
